OL,3,GNEWSAHalf-term airport strikes warning
OL,4,Ain pay dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther strikes have been announced at
OL,7,FLeeds Bradford Airport (LBA), with
OL,8,Findustrial action planned for October
OL,9,Fhalf-term.
OL,11,FAlmost 130 Unite members, including air
OL,12,Ftraffic control workers, customer
OL,13,Fexperience staff, security staff and
OL,14,Fcleaners, could walk out over pay
OL,15,Fbetween 16 and 18 October, with action
OL,16,Falso planned for 23 October to 2
OL,17,FNovember.
OL,19,FThe union said the airport was expected
OL,20,Fto experience a shutdown on the strike
OL,21,Fdays, "with so many essential workers
OL,22,Fstriking".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
